==English==

===Etymology===
From [[un-]] + [[tangle]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-untangle.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|æŋɡəl|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|untangl}}

# To remove [[tangle]]s or [[knot]]s.
#: ''With gentle combing, '''untangle''' your hair.''
# (by extension) To remove [[confusion]] or [[mystery]].
#: ''It took awhile, but he finally '''untangled''' the problem.''

====Synonyms====
